// purpose: KQL to detect if Polyfill malicious payload was loaded
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/KQL%20to%20detect%20if%20Polyfill%20malicious%20payload%20was%20loaded.kql
